1
00:00:01,508 --> 00:00:02,884
KATARA: Water...

2
00:00:03,760 --> 00:00:05,053
Earth...

3
00:00:05,803 --> 00:00:07,222
Fire...

4
00:00:07,722 --> 00:00:09,140
Air.

5
00:00:10,141 --> 00:00:13,853
Long ago, the four nations lived
together in harmony.

6
00:00:14,395 --> 00:00:18,066
Then everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

7
00:00:18,650 --> 00:00:22,278
Only the Avatar, master of
all four elements, could stop them.

8
00:00:22,362 --> 00:00:26,449
But when the world needed him most,
he vanished.

9
00:00:26,533 --> 00:00:30,078
100 years passed and my brother and I
discovered the new Avatar...

10
00:00:30,161 --> 00:00:31,913
An airbender named Aang.

11
00:00:31,996 --> 00:00:34,082
And although his airbending
skills are great

12
00:00:34,165 --> 00:00:37,252
he has a lot to learn before
he's ready to save anyone.

13
00:00:37,835 --> 00:00:41,839
But I believe Aang can save the world.

14
00:00:42,507 --> 00:00:44,175
( ♪... )

15
00:00:46,970 --> 00:00:49,264
MAN: Previously on Avatar...

16
00:00:49,472 --> 00:00:52,100
You and Sokka have to go
with Aang somewhere safe.

17
00:00:52,433 --> 00:00:54,894
It's the only way to keep hope alive.

18
00:00:54,978 --> 00:00:58,481
I'm going to join the Avatar,
and I'm going to help him defeat you.

19
00:00:58,690 --> 00:01:02,527
Since you're a full-blown traitor now
and you want me gone, why wait?

20
00:01:02,860 --> 00:01:04,946
Because I know my own destiny.

21
00:01:05,029 --> 00:01:07,407
Taking you down is the Avatar's destiny.

22
00:01:07,615 --> 00:01:10,243
AANG: I know just the place for us to go
where we'll be safe for a while.

23
00:01:10,577 --> 00:01:12,328
The Western Air Temple.

24
00:01:23,214 --> 00:01:26,175
( APPA SNORTING )

25
00:01:30,054 --> 00:01:32,473
( MOMO CHATTERING )

26
00:01:36,936 --> 00:01:38,187
This is humiliating.

27
00:01:38,271 --> 00:01:40,440
Do you mean getting thoroughly
spanked by the Fire Nation

28
00:01:40,565 --> 00:01:43,359
or having to walk all the way
to the Western Air Temple?

29
00:01:43,651 --> 00:01:45,111
Both.

30
00:01:45,445 --> 00:01:48,156
Sorry, guys, but Appa gets tired
carrying all these people.

31
00:01:51,326 --> 00:01:53,244
I wonder how the rest of the troops are.

32
00:01:53,578 --> 00:01:55,538
They're probably on their way to a prison.

33
00:01:55,622 --> 00:01:58,791
Seems like my dad just got out,
now he's going back in.

34
00:02:00,126 --> 00:02:01,711
I miss Pipsqueak.

35
00:02:01,794 --> 00:02:04,631
I miss not having blisters on my feet.

36
00:02:06,966 --> 00:02:08,134
Hey, we're here.

37
00:02:08,217 --> 00:02:09,927
I can feel it.

38
00:02:10,011 --> 00:02:13,973
KATARA: Uh, I think your feet
need their eyes checked.

39
00:02:14,974 --> 00:02:18,394
No, she's right, we are here.

40
00:02:20,980 --> 00:02:24,233
TOPH: Wow, it's amazing.

41
00:02:59,686 --> 00:03:02,647
IROH: What a stunning view.

42
00:03:02,980 --> 00:03:07,110
The only view I'm interested in seeing is
the Avatar in chains.

43
00:03:07,318 --> 00:03:12,073
You know, the Avatar hasn't been
seen for 100 years.

44
00:03:12,156 --> 00:03:16,619
The chances of finding him here
are very slim.

45
00:03:17,161 --> 00:03:18,788
First, we'll check each of
the air temples.

46
00:03:18,871 --> 00:03:20,081
Then we'll scour the world,

47
00:03:20,164 --> 00:03:22,792
searching even the most remote locations
until we find him.

48
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:28,297
Prince Zuko, it's only been a week since
your banishment.

49
00:03:28,881 --> 00:03:32,009
You should take some time
to heal and rest.

50
00:03:32,093 --> 00:03:35,346
What else would I expect to hear from
the laziest man in the Fire Nation?

51
00:03:36,848 --> 00:03:38,474
( SIGHS )

52
00:03:38,808 --> 00:03:42,061
The only way to regain my honor
is to find the Avatar.

53
00:03:42,145 --> 00:03:43,855
So I will.

54
00:03:48,025 --> 00:03:50,069
( GROANS )

55
00:03:50,278 --> 00:03:52,280
( APPA GRUNTING )

56
00:04:06,919 --> 00:04:09,422
It's so different from
the Northern Air Temple.

57
00:04:09,505 --> 00:04:11,382
I wonder if there are any secret rooms.

58
00:04:11,716 --> 00:04:13,009
Let's go check it out.

59
00:04:18,347 --> 00:04:21,684
You guys go...
I think we need to talk about some things.

60
00:04:22,977 --> 00:04:24,604
I'll race you, Duke.

61
00:04:24,687 --> 00:04:27,565
I told you, it's "The Duke."

62
00:04:27,648 --> 00:04:28,649
Why can't I go?

63
00:04:28,816 --> 00:04:31,027
We need to decide what we're gonna do now

64
00:04:31,152 --> 00:04:34,030
And since you're the Avatar,
maybe you should be a part of this.

65
00:04:36,407 --> 00:04:37,617
Fair enough.

66
00:04:37,700 --> 00:04:39,786
So what's the new plan?

67
00:04:39,994 --> 00:04:44,624
Well, if you ask me,
the new plan is the old plan.

68
00:04:44,707 --> 00:04:46,709
You just need to master all four elements

69
00:04:46,793 --> 00:04:48,961
and confront the Fire Lord
before the comet comes.

70
00:04:49,170 --> 00:04:53,841
Oh, yeah, that's great,
no problem, I'll just do that.

71
00:04:54,091 --> 00:04:56,302
Aang, no one said it's gonna be easy.

72
00:04:56,594 --> 00:04:58,429
Well, it's not even gonna be possible.

73
00:04:58,513 --> 00:05:01,015
Where am I supposed to get
a firebending teacher?

74
00:05:02,183 --> 00:05:03,726
We could look for Jeong Jeong.

75
00:05:03,935 --> 00:05:06,020
Yeah, right.

76
00:05:06,229 --> 00:05:08,439
Like we'll ever run into
Jeong Jeong again.

77
00:05:08,648 --> 00:05:10,900
Who's... Oh, never mind.

78
00:05:10,983 --> 00:05:12,902
If it's important, I'll find out.

79
00:05:13,236 --> 00:05:15,988
Oh, well, guess we can't
come up with anybody.

80
00:05:16,197 --> 00:05:19,867
Why don't we just take a nice
tour around the temple?

81
00:05:20,076 --> 00:05:22,161
( MOMO CHATTERING )

82
00:05:22,370 --> 00:05:23,704
TOPH: What's up with him?

83
00:05:25,164 --> 00:05:28,167
There's got to be someone
who can teach him firebending.

84
00:05:32,004 --> 00:05:34,173
Hello, Zuko here.

85
00:05:34,257 --> 00:05:37,468
But I guess you probably already
know me... Sort of.

86
00:05:37,593 --> 00:05:42,014
Uh, so, the thing is,
I have a lot of firebending experience

87
00:05:42,098 --> 00:05:44,392
and I'm considered to be
pretty good at it.

88
00:05:44,559 --> 00:05:47,687
Well, you've seen me...
You know, when I was attacking you?

89
00:05:48,145 --> 00:05:50,731
Uh, yeah, I guess I should
apologize for that.

90
00:05:50,815 --> 00:05:52,692
But anyway, I'm good now.

91
00:05:52,859 --> 00:05:55,695
I mean, I thought I was good before,
but now I realize I was bad.

92
00:05:56,028 --> 00:06:00,074
But anyway...
I think it's time I joined your group

93
00:06:00,408 --> 00:06:02,785
and taught the Avatar firebending.

94
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:08,291
( CROAKING )

95
00:06:08,624 --> 00:06:10,751
Well, what's your answer?

96
00:06:11,043 --> 00:06:12,962
( CROAKS )

97
00:06:13,170 --> 00:06:15,214
Yeah, that's what I'd say too.

98
00:06:16,507 --> 00:06:19,552
How am I supposed to convince
these people I'm on their side?

99
00:06:19,927 --> 00:06:21,762
What would uncle do?

100
00:06:21,846 --> 00:06:25,224
"Zuko, you have to look within yourself

101
00:06:25,474 --> 00:06:28,603
"To save yourself from your other self.

102
00:06:28,895 --> 00:06:34,483
"Only then will your true self
reveal itself."

103
00:06:34,901 --> 00:06:36,861
( SIGHS )

104
00:06:37,069 --> 00:06:39,822
Even when I'm talking for him,
I can't figure out what he means.

105
00:06:39,989 --> 00:06:41,699
What would Azula do?

106
00:06:41,824 --> 00:06:46,037
"Listen, Avatar, I can join your group

107
00:06:46,245 --> 00:06:49,540
"Or I can do something unspeakably
horrible to you and your friends.

108
00:06:49,749 --> 00:06:51,542
"Your choice."

109
00:06:52,543 --> 00:06:55,212
I guess I'm not that good
at impersonations.

110
00:06:56,047 --> 00:06:57,506
( CROAKS )

111
00:06:58,883 --> 00:07:02,303
( APPA GROANING )

112
00:07:07,725 --> 00:07:10,853
KATARA: Aang, can we talk about
you learning firebending now?

113
00:07:11,062 --> 00:07:12,313
What?

114
00:07:12,396 --> 00:07:15,274
The wind is too loud in my ears.

115
00:07:15,399 --> 00:07:18,027
Check out this loop.

116
00:07:18,319 --> 00:07:21,197
( MOMO CHATTERING )

117
00:07:21,405 --> 00:07:24,992
SOKKA: Aang, I think we should be making
some plans about our future.

118
00:07:25,201 --> 00:07:29,830
AANG: OK, we can do that
while I show you the giant Pai Sho table.

119
00:07:30,039 --> 00:07:32,625
Oh, and you're gonna love
the all-day echo chamber.

120
00:07:32,833 --> 00:07:34,460
I think that'll have to wait.

121
00:07:34,669 --> 00:07:37,755
( APPA GROANING )

122
00:07:37,838 --> 00:07:40,883
( MOMO CHATTERING )

123
00:07:41,050 --> 00:07:43,761
Hello, Zuko here.

124
00:07:49,850 --> 00:07:52,103
Hey, I heard you guys flying around
down there,

125
00:07:52,186 --> 00:07:54,939
so I just thought I'd wait for you here.

126
00:07:56,399 --> 00:07:58,442
( ROARS )

127
00:07:58,609 --> 00:08:00,194
( GRUNTS )

128
00:08:02,446 --> 00:08:04,365
( GRUNTS )

129
00:08:05,449 --> 00:08:07,743
I know you must be surprised
to see me here.

130
00:08:08,202 --> 00:08:11,080
Not really, since you've
followed us all over the world.

131
00:08:11,455 --> 00:08:14,250
Right... Well, uh...

132
00:08:14,458 --> 00:08:19,130
Anyway, what I wanted to tell
you about is that I've changed

133
00:08:19,338 --> 00:08:21,924
and I, uh, I'm good now.

134
00:08:22,008 --> 00:08:23,676
And, well, I think I should
join your group.

135
00:08:23,884 --> 00:08:25,761
Oh, and I can teach firebending...

136
00:08:26,137 --> 00:08:28,472
To you.

137
00:08:29,849 --> 00:08:30,933
See, I, uh...

138
00:08:31,100 --> 00:08:32,560
You want to what now?

139
00:08:32,685 --> 00:08:35,980
You can't possibly think that any of us
would trust you, can you?

140
00:08:36,063 --> 00:08:38,315
I mean, how stupid do you think we are?

141
00:08:38,399 --> 00:08:41,694
Yeah, all you've ever done is try to
hunt us down and capture Aang.

142
00:08:41,777 --> 00:08:43,487
I've done some good things.

143
00:08:43,571 --> 00:08:46,949
I mean, I could've stolen your bison in
Ba Sing Se, but I set him free.

144
00:08:47,033 --> 00:08:49,243
That's something.

145
00:08:51,037 --> 00:08:53,456
Appa does seem to like him.

146
00:08:53,539 --> 00:08:56,751
He probably just covered himself in honey
or something so that Appa would lick him.

147
00:08:56,876 --> 00:08:58,335
I'm not buying it.

148
00:08:58,753 --> 00:09:01,047
I can understand why you wouldn't trust me

149
00:09:01,130 --> 00:09:03,340
and I know I've made some
mistakes in the past.

150
00:09:03,424 --> 00:09:04,800
SOKKA: Like when you attacked our village?

151
00:09:04,884 --> 00:09:08,763
Or when you stole my mother's necklace and
used it to track us down and capture us?

152
00:09:09,388 --> 00:09:12,600
Look, I admit I've done some awful things.

153
00:09:12,683 --> 00:09:14,560
I was wrong to try to capture you,

154
00:09:14,643 --> 00:09:16,771
and I'm sorry that I attacked
the Water Tribe.

155
00:09:16,854 --> 00:09:19,065
And I never should've sent that
Fire Nation assassin after you.

156
00:09:19,273 --> 00:09:20,858
I'm gonna try to stop him.

157
00:09:20,941 --> 00:09:22,985
Wait, you sent Combustion Man after us?

158
00:09:23,319 --> 00:09:25,780
Well, that's not his name, but...

159
00:09:25,863 --> 00:09:28,783
Oh, sorry, I didn't mean to
insult your friend.

160
00:09:28,866 --> 00:09:30,785
He's not my friend.

161
00:09:30,868 --> 00:09:34,413
That guy locked me and Katara
in jail and tried to blow us all up.

162
00:09:36,165 --> 00:09:38,375
Why aren't you saying anything?

163
00:09:38,584 --> 00:09:41,879
You once said you thought
we could be friends.

164
00:09:42,088 --> 00:09:44,090
You know I have good in me.

165
00:09:49,136 --> 00:09:51,972
There's no way we can trust you
after everything you've done.

166
00:09:52,181 --> 00:09:53,933
We'll never let you join us.

167
00:09:55,142 --> 00:09:57,686
KATARA: You need to get out of here, now.

168
00:10:00,481 --> 00:10:03,984
I'm trying to explain that
I'm not that person anymore.

169
00:10:04,068 --> 00:10:05,945
Either you leave or we attack.

170
00:10:07,238 --> 00:10:11,158
If you won't accept me as a friend,
then maybe you'll take me as a prisoner.

171
00:10:11,617 --> 00:10:13,160
No, we won't.

172
00:10:13,244 --> 00:10:14,912
( GRUNTS )

173
00:10:14,995 --> 00:10:17,289
KATARA: Get out of here
and don't come back.

174
00:10:17,373 --> 00:10:21,502
And if we ever see you again...
Well, we'd better not see you again.

175
00:10:26,841 --> 00:10:28,551
( MOMO CHATTERING )

176
00:10:38,269 --> 00:10:40,896
( GROANS ) I can't believe how stupid I am.

177
00:10:40,980 --> 00:10:42,690
I mean, what was I thinking?

178
00:10:42,773 --> 00:10:44,775
Telling them I sent an assassin
after them?

179
00:10:45,067 --> 00:10:46,569
Why didn't I just say Azula did that?

180
00:10:46,652 --> 00:10:47,903
They would've believed that.

181
00:10:47,987 --> 00:10:49,947
Stupid.

182
00:10:50,447 --> 00:10:51,866
( CROAKS )

183
00:10:52,867 --> 00:10:54,952
( GROANS )

184
00:10:56,495 --> 00:10:58,497
KATARA: Why would he try to
fool us like that?

185
00:10:58,581 --> 00:11:01,333
SOKKA: Obviously, he wants to
lead us into some kind of trap.

186
00:11:01,417 --> 00:11:04,503
KATARA: This is just like when we were in
prison together in Ba Sing Se.

187
00:11:04,587 --> 00:11:06,672
He starts talking about his mother

188
00:11:06,755 --> 00:11:08,799
and making it seem like he's
an actual human being with feelings.

189
00:11:08,924 --> 00:11:11,760
He wants you to trust him
and feel sorry for him

190
00:11:11,844 --> 00:11:14,680
so you let your guard down,
then he strikes.

191
00:11:15,347 --> 00:11:17,766
The thing is, it worked.

192
00:11:17,850 --> 00:11:19,518
I did feel sorry for him.

193
00:11:19,602 --> 00:11:22,438
I felt like he was really
confused and hurt.

194
00:11:22,771 --> 00:11:25,816
But obviously when the time came
he made his choice

195
00:11:26,025 --> 00:11:28,027
and we paid the price.

196
00:11:28,360 --> 00:11:30,196
We can't trust him.

197
00:11:30,279 --> 00:11:31,906
AANG: I kind of have a confession to make.

198
00:11:32,239 --> 00:11:34,909
Remember when you two were sick
and I got captured by Zhao?

199
00:11:35,117 --> 00:11:36,869
And you made us suck on frozen frogs?

200
00:11:36,952 --> 00:11:38,621
How could I forget?

201
00:11:38,704 --> 00:11:42,499
I had a wart on the flap that hangs down
from the back of my throat for a month.

202
00:11:43,083 --> 00:11:46,879
Sokka, I looked at it and told you
there was nothing there.

203
00:11:46,962 --> 00:11:49,924
I could feel it...
It's my throatal flap.

204
00:11:50,341 --> 00:11:54,553
AANG: Anyway, when Zhao had me chained up,
it was Zuko who came in and got me out.

205
00:11:54,678 --> 00:11:56,680
He risked his life to save me.

206
00:11:56,889 --> 00:12:00,684
No way, I'm sure he only did it
so he could capture you himself.

207
00:12:00,768 --> 00:12:03,187
Yeah, face it, Aang,
you're nothing but a big prize to him.

208
00:12:03,270 --> 00:12:05,105
You're probably right.

209
00:12:05,189 --> 00:12:07,566
And what was all that crazy
stuff about setting Appa free?

210
00:12:07,650 --> 00:12:09,610
What a liar.

211
00:12:09,693 --> 00:12:10,736
Actually, he wasn't lying.

212
00:12:11,904 --> 00:12:13,405
Oh, hooray.

213
00:12:13,489 --> 00:12:17,243
In a lifetime of evil, at least he didn't
add animal cruelty to the list.

214
00:12:17,326 --> 00:12:21,580
I'm just saying that considering his
messed-up family and how he was raised

215
00:12:21,747 --> 00:12:23,916
he could've turned out a lot worse.

216
00:12:24,208 --> 00:12:27,253
You're right, Toph, let's go
find him and give him a medal...

217
00:12:27,378 --> 00:12:30,339
The "not as much of a jerk
as you could've been" award.

218
00:12:30,673 --> 00:12:34,718
All I know is that while he was
talking to us, he was sincere.

219
00:12:34,843 --> 00:12:38,597
Maybe you're all just letting your hurt
feelings keep you from thinking clearly.

220
00:12:38,722 --> 00:12:42,309
Easy for you to say, you weren't there
when he had us attacked by pirates.

221
00:12:42,393 --> 00:12:44,645
Or when he burned down Kyoshi Island.

222
00:12:44,728 --> 00:12:47,106
Or when he tried to capture me
at the Fire Temple.

223
00:12:47,356 --> 00:12:49,817
Why would you even try to defend him?

224
00:12:49,900 --> 00:12:54,029
Because, Katara, you're all
ignoring one crucial fact.

225
00:12:54,363 --> 00:12:56,699
Aang needs a firebending teacher.

226
00:12:56,782 --> 00:12:59,201
We can't think of a single person in
the world to do the job.

227
00:12:59,660 --> 00:13:03,372
Now one shows upon a silver platter and
you won't even think about it?

228
00:13:06,500 --> 00:13:09,670
I'm not having Zuko as my teacher.

229
00:13:09,837 --> 00:13:11,422
You're darn right you're not, buddy.

230
00:13:11,505 --> 00:13:13,424
Well, I guess that's settled.

231
00:13:14,133 --> 00:13:17,761
( GROANS ) I'm beginning to wonder
who's really the blind one around here.

232
00:13:25,227 --> 00:13:26,645
( LEAVES RUSTLING )

233
00:13:26,854 --> 00:13:29,315
Who's there?

234
00:13:29,398 --> 00:13:30,399
Stay back.

235
00:13:30,482 --> 00:13:31,859
It's me!

236
00:13:32,067 --> 00:13:33,819
Ow!

237
00:13:35,738 --> 00:13:37,239
You burned my feet.

238
00:13:37,448 --> 00:13:39,408
I'm sorry, it was a mistake.

239
00:13:40,034 --> 00:13:42,036
Get away from me.

240
00:13:45,331 --> 00:13:46,915
Let me help you.

241
00:13:47,124 --> 00:13:48,751
I'm sorry.

242
00:13:49,918 --> 00:13:52,212
Get off me, get off me.

243
00:13:52,421 --> 00:13:54,631
( GRUNTS )

244
00:13:55,049 --> 00:13:57,551
I didn't know it was you.
( GROANS )

245
00:13:57,760 --> 00:13:59,386
Come back!

246
00:14:01,347 --> 00:14:02,765
( GROANS )

247
00:14:02,848 --> 00:14:05,517
Why am I so bad at being good?

248
00:14:16,653 --> 00:14:18,572
Has anyone seen Toph?

249
00:14:18,655 --> 00:14:20,866
I haven't seen her
since she stormed off yesterday.

250
00:14:20,949 --> 00:14:23,035
Maybe she's just exploring the Air Temple.

251
00:14:23,118 --> 00:14:26,121
There are some pretty fun spots
to practice earthbending.

252
00:14:26,747 --> 00:14:28,582
I think we should go look for her.

253
00:14:28,791 --> 00:14:30,709
Oh, let her have fun with her rocks.

254
00:14:30,793 --> 00:14:32,669
I'm in no rush to have her
yelling at us again.

255
00:14:33,003 --> 00:14:35,130
We can go check for her.

256
00:14:35,214 --> 00:14:37,925
Yeah, I want to ride that tunnel down
to the hall of statues again.

257
00:14:38,050 --> 00:14:41,261
It'll work a lot better now that I fixed
my brakes.

258
00:14:44,765 --> 00:14:49,269
( CRASH )

259
00:14:49,353 --> 00:14:50,854
( GRUNTING )

260
00:14:51,188 --> 00:14:52,815
KATARA: Toph, what happened?

261
00:14:52,940 --> 00:14:54,316
My feet got burned.

262
00:14:54,525 --> 00:14:56,527
Oh, no, what happened?

263
00:14:56,693 --> 00:14:59,988
I just told you, my feet got burned.

264
00:15:00,197 --> 00:15:02,032
I meant how.

265
00:15:02,241 --> 00:15:04,493
Well, I kind of went to see Zuko
last night.

266
00:15:04,576 --> 00:15:05,828
You what?

267
00:15:05,911 --> 00:15:07,496
- Zuko?
-( GASPS )

268
00:15:07,579 --> 00:15:09,581
I just thought he could be helpful to us

269
00:15:09,665 --> 00:15:12,751
and if I talked to him,
maybe we could work something out.

270
00:15:13,043 --> 00:15:14,503
So he attacked you?

271
00:15:14,753 --> 00:15:17,047
Well, he did and he didn't.

272
00:15:17,131 --> 00:15:19,299
It was sort of an accident.

273
00:15:19,550 --> 00:15:20,884
But he did firebend at you?

274
00:15:20,968 --> 00:15:23,387
( SIGHS ) Yes.

275
00:15:23,512 --> 00:15:27,975
See, you trusted Zuko and
you got burned... Literally.

276
00:15:28,058 --> 00:15:30,310
It's gonna take a while
for your feet to get better.

277
00:15:30,561 --> 00:15:31,979
I wish I could've worked on them sooner.

278
00:15:32,271 --> 00:15:33,814
Yeah, me too.

279
00:15:33,897 --> 00:15:36,066
Zuko's clearly too dangerous
to be left alone.

280
00:15:36,358 --> 00:15:37,943
We're gonna have to go after him.

281
00:15:38,193 --> 00:15:40,446
I hate to go looking for
a fight, but you're right.

282
00:15:40,612 --> 00:15:44,032
After what he did to Toph,
I don't think we have a choice.

283
00:15:44,116 --> 00:15:46,285
He's crafty, but we'll find
a way to capture him.

284
00:15:46,702 --> 00:15:48,537
TOPH: Maybe just invite him back here.

285
00:15:48,620 --> 00:15:51,457
He's already offered himself up
as a prisoner once.

286
00:15:51,540 --> 00:15:55,377
Yeah... Get him to come back
and say he'll be our prisoner

287
00:15:55,586 --> 00:15:58,464
then we'll jump him and really
make him our prisoner.

288
00:15:58,547 --> 00:16:00,340
He'll never suspect it.

289
00:16:00,424 --> 00:16:02,634
You are a master of surprise, Sokka.

290
00:16:05,179 --> 00:16:07,639
Ahh, that's the stuff.

291
00:16:07,848 --> 00:16:09,975
Now I know how the rest of you guys feel.

292
00:16:10,350 --> 00:16:13,103
Not being able to see
with your feet stinks.

293
00:16:33,582 --> 00:16:35,250
( GRUNTS )

294
00:16:44,134 --> 00:16:45,719
ZUKO: Stop!

295
00:16:45,969 --> 00:16:49,890
I don't want you
hunting the Avatar anymore.

296
00:16:50,057 --> 00:16:51,433
The mission is off.

297
00:16:51,517 --> 00:16:53,310
I'm ordering you to stop.

298
00:16:53,519 --> 00:16:54,728
( GRUNTS )

299
00:16:58,148 --> 00:16:59,942
If you keep attacking, I won't pay you.

300
00:17:00,692 --> 00:17:04,571
( GRUNTS ) All right,
I'll pay you double to stop.

301
00:17:14,331 --> 00:17:15,374
( GRUNTS )

302
00:17:53,203 --> 00:17:54,204
( ROARS )

303
00:18:08,677 --> 00:18:12,764
He's going to blast this whole
place right off the cliffside.

304
00:18:13,390 --> 00:18:15,392
( EXPLOSION )

305
00:18:16,101 --> 00:18:19,313
I can't step out to waterbend at him
without getting blown up.

306
00:18:19,521 --> 00:18:22,983
And I can't get a good enough
angle on him from down here.

307
00:18:23,150 --> 00:18:25,861
I know how to get an angle on him.

308
00:18:41,710 --> 00:18:44,838
All right, buddy, don't fail me now.

309
00:18:51,178 --> 00:18:52,763
( GRUNTS )

310
00:18:55,307 --> 00:18:58,644
Yeah, boomerang!

311
00:19:02,939 --> 00:19:06,360
Aw, boomerang...

312
00:19:12,449 --> 00:19:13,450
( GRUNTS )

313
00:19:36,264 --> 00:19:38,266
( GRUNTS )

314
00:19:48,110 --> 00:19:51,405
I can't believe I'm saying this,
but thanks, Zuko.

315
00:19:51,613 --> 00:19:52,864
Hey, and what about me?

316
00:19:52,948 --> 00:19:54,282
I did the boomerang thing.

317
00:19:54,533 --> 00:19:58,078
Listen, I know I didn't explain
myself very well yesterday.

318
00:19:58,161 --> 00:20:01,164
I've been through a lot in the past
few years, and it's been hard.

319
00:20:02,124 --> 00:20:05,252
But I'm realizing that I had to
go through all those things

320
00:20:05,335 --> 00:20:07,170
to learn the truth.

321
00:20:07,254 --> 00:20:11,675
I thought I had lost my honor and that
somehow my father could return it to me.

322
00:20:11,883 --> 00:20:14,845
But I know now that no one can
give you your honor.

323
00:20:15,095 --> 00:20:18,473
It's something you earn for yourself
by choosing to do what's right.

324
00:20:18,724 --> 00:20:22,018
All I want now is to play
my part in ending this war.

325
00:20:22,227 --> 00:20:26,398
And I know my destiny is
to help you restore balance to the world.

326
00:20:27,441 --> 00:20:29,860
I'm sorry for what I did to you.

327
00:20:29,943 --> 00:20:31,486
It was an accident.

328
00:20:31,570 --> 00:20:33,822
Fire can be dangerous and wild.

329
00:20:33,905 --> 00:20:37,826
So as a firebender, I need to be more
careful and control my bending

330
00:20:37,909 --> 00:20:40,662
so I don't hurt people unintentionally.

331
00:20:42,539 --> 00:20:45,625
I think you are supposed to be
my firebending teacher.

332
00:20:45,876 --> 00:20:49,838
When I first tried to learn
firebending, I burned Katara.

333
00:20:50,338 --> 00:20:53,884
And after that, I never wanted
to firebend again.

334
00:20:54,926 --> 00:20:59,014
But now I know you understand how easy
it is to hurt the people you love.

335
00:21:00,098 --> 00:21:02,893
I'd like you to teach me.

336
00:21:04,561 --> 00:21:06,188
Thank you.

337
00:21:07,689 --> 00:21:09,858
I'm so happy you've accepted me
into your group.

338
00:21:09,941 --> 00:21:11,651
AANG: Not so fast.

339
00:21:11,860 --> 00:21:14,154
I still have to ask my friends
if it's OK with them.

340
00:21:14,780 --> 00:21:17,157
Toph, you're the one that Zuko burned.

341
00:21:17,365 --> 00:21:19,951
What do you think?

342
00:21:20,035 --> 00:21:22,037
Go ahead and let him join.

343
00:21:22,120 --> 00:21:24,956
It'll give me plenty of time
to get back at him for burning my feet.

344
00:21:25,415 --> 00:21:26,958
Sokka?

345
00:21:28,794 --> 00:21:31,713
Hey, all I want is to defeat
the Fire Lord.

346
00:21:31,922 --> 00:21:34,925
If you think this is the way to do it,
then I'm all for it.

347
00:21:36,968 --> 00:21:38,553
Katara?

348
00:21:45,310 --> 00:21:48,438
I'll go along with
whatever you think is right.

349
00:21:49,815 --> 00:21:52,234
I won't let you down, I promise.

350
00:22:03,078 --> 00:22:06,206
So here you go, home sweet home.

351
00:22:06,331 --> 00:22:07,707
I guess, you know, for now.

352
00:22:08,083 --> 00:22:10,752
Unpack... Lunch soon.

353
00:22:11,461 --> 00:22:13,964
Uh... Welcome aboard?

354
00:22:16,925 --> 00:22:18,218
Yeah.

355
00:22:19,469 --> 00:22:22,055
OK, this is really, really weird.

356
00:22:30,856 --> 00:22:35,694
If I have to, I will spend every day of
the rest of my life hunting the Avatar.

357
00:22:35,819 --> 00:22:38,196
I know it's my destiny to capture him.

358
00:22:38,280 --> 00:22:42,534
You know, prince Zuko,
destiny is a funny thing.

359
00:22:43,034 --> 00:22:46,371
You never know how things
are going to work out

360
00:22:46,580 --> 00:22:50,375
but if you keep an open mind
and an open heart

361
00:22:50,959 --> 00:22:54,754
I promise you will find
your own destiny someday.

362
00:23:02,888 --> 00:23:06,850
KATARA: You might have everyone else here
buying your transformation.

363
00:23:07,183 --> 00:23:10,896
But you and I both know you've struggled
with doing the right thing in the past.

364
00:23:11,062 --> 00:23:14,399
So let me tell you something right now.

365
00:23:14,524 --> 00:23:17,277
You make one step backward, one slip-up,

366
00:23:17,360 --> 00:23:19,905
give me one reason
to think you might hurt Aang

367
00:23:20,113 --> 00:23:22,782
and you won't have to worry
about your destiny anymore

368
00:23:23,158 --> 00:23:26,912
because I'll make sure your destiny
ends right then and there...

369
00:23:27,287 --> 00:23:29,873
Permanently.

370
00:23:44,638 --> 00:23:47,349
( ♪... )
